Source: libkysdk-mcp
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: guopengfei <guopengfei@kylinos.cn>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 12),
               cmake,
               libssl-dev

Standards-Version: 4.4.1
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Package: libkysdk-mcp
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Kylin MCP runtime libraries
 This package is an aggregate runtime package that ships two shared libraries:
 libkysdk-mcp-client.so.* and libkysdk-mcp-server.so.*.
 It is intentionally named as a single SDK runtime package while the internal
 components remain split into client/server shared objects.

Package: libkysdk-mcp-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libkysdk-mcp (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Development files for libkysdk-mcp
 This package provides:
 - public headers under include/kylin-ai/mcp
 - linker symlinks for libkysdk-mcp-client.so and libkysdk-mcp-server.so
 - pkg-config files: kysdk-mcp-client.pc and kysdk-mcp-server.pc
 It is intended for building applications against both client and server
 components of libkysdk-mcp.
